clients.text:
Cutlass over plain HTTP (curl, scripts, any language)
Base URL: {url}
Every request needs the header Authorization: Bearer <token>
Token: {token}
Tools: {url}v1/tools?format=markdown and the OpenAPI document {url}v1/openapi.json
Call a tool: POST {url}v1/call with {"tool": "<name>", "args": { ... }}
Example: powershell -File build/examples/agent-http.ps1
